      <p begin="02:20.490" end="02:23.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That's why they gassin' me up (oh, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:23.380" end="02:25.850" ttm:agent="v1">I'm goin' fast, on the run</p>
      <p begin="02:25.850" end="02:27.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Where you from? (Where you from?)</p>
      <p begin="02:27.340" end="02:29.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">What you want? (What do you want? Uh)</p>
      <p begin="02:29.820" end="02:31.950" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, yeah, we slumped</p>
