      <p begin="02:54.760" end="02:57.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">People ain't come from where I'm from, like they don't know (they don't know)</p>
      <p begin="02:57.420" end="03:00.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Gettin' bigger, gettin' bigger, man, like they don't know (they don't know)</p>
      <p begin="03:00.560" end="03:03.460" ttm:agent="v1">Fast kid, rich as hell and you know I'ma score</p>
      <p begin="03:03.460" end="03:05.930" ttm:agent="v1">How you figured that? Came up from the floor, man, I'ma go</p>
      <p begin="03:05.930" end="03:08.490" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a young hitter, gassin' out the pump</p>
      <p begin="03:08.490" end="03:10.940" ttm:agent="v1">I'm number one, I'm number one</p>
